  "aboutArrow1": "  → Avoid taking extra risks here\n\n",
  "aboutBullet2": "• Areas where Sure answers or educated guesses are usually correct\n",
  "aboutArrow2": "  → Take smarter risks here\n\n",
  "aboutBullet3": "• Common UPSC trap patterns and tricky question types\n",
